# Generated by tape.ml: permanent history above bounded current activity.
Require dune
Output "ocaml-console/examples/layout/layout.gif"

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 460
Set Theme "Builtin Dark"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 20ms

Type "opam exec -- dune exec ocaml-console/examples/layout/main.exe"
Enter
Wait+Screen /transfers complete/
Sleep 2s
